 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "Scales for the challenge to bring witnesses (not the Mizan); they leave before «فإن شهدوا». The claim «أن الله حرم هذا» is framed by As-Sa'di's «فتكون دعواهم إذًا باطلة». STAGING v4: Staged: the idolaters who forbade crops and cattle (3 men in dark robes gathered at the centre of a town at dusk, facing no empty side). The challenge (150:1-9) comes from the Prophet, who is not shown and gets no plate on «قل»; the scales plate stands for the demand for witnesses (150:3-5), not the Mizan. They speak their claim on 150:8 (framed by «فتكون دعواهم إذًا باطلة»), nobody testifies (the condition 150:10-14 is not acted), they shake their heads on 150:19 (denying the verses), and geometric stands for 150:26-27."
